Need for Speed: Carbon is the original game represented by this project.
Original game names, executable code, artwork, audio, tracks, cinematics and
other data retain their original ownership and notices. Original in-game
credits are preserved. This project is not affiliated with or endorsed by
Electronic Arts. "Need for Speed" and "Carbon" are trademarks of Electronic
Arts Inc.

Original game files are not distributed in this repository. The app is built
locally from the player's own copy of the game; the game's executable, data,
artwork, audio, tracks and cinematics are still required from that copy and
are never included. The app icon is read from the player's own NFSC.exe at
build time; the fallback icon in tools/setup_kit/defaults is original artwork.

The native host, compatibility runtime and translator are recomp-kit by
veritr1x, included in kit/ with this port's changes, under its own LICENSE and
NOTICE. The port's setup and much of its approach follow the Need for Speed:
Most Wanted Mac port (github.com/elforeign/nfs-most-wanted-mac).

Third-party work this port reimplements:

- NFSCarbon.WidescreenFix, part of WidescreenFixesPack by ThirteenAG
  (github.com/ThirteenAG/WidescreenFixesPack). Its resolution and field-of-view
  changes are reimplemented in mods/core/nfsc and game.toml. Its license:

